        "node_id": "n_9_3fecaa",
        "thought_text": "Optimize the dynamic programming approach by focusing on finding the longest palindromic substring that starts from the beginning of the string and ends at the end, ensuring it can be split into a prefix and a suffix. This might involve modifying the DP table to track the maximum palindrome length ending at each position and starting from the beginning.",
